    "summary": "esbuild built zod in 15.9 ms at the median. Vite took 170.4 ms (10.7x slower); tsup took 203.6 ms (12.8x slower). esbuild and tsup produced byte-identical 426 KB bundles. Vite's output was 482 KB — the difference is almost entirely whitespace that Vite preserves in ES library builds for downstream tree-shaking."
